            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Hey Musician and Audio Fanboy!<br><br>Need a pause from playing Room Escape games like VR: Vacate the Room?<br><br>Ever wanted to try the <strong>Theremin </strong>without paying hundreds of Dollars?<br>Now you can!<br><br>Get <strong>VRemin </strong>- the Virtual Theremin.<br><br>Enter the (virtual) stage and play this old instrument with 4 Oscillators to chose from.<br>You could also be part of a band made of virtual instruments.<br><br>Have fun ;)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Virtual Stage - Concert Hall<br></li><li>A Virtual Theremin<br></li><li>4 Oscillators to choose from<br></li><li>Adjust your Theremin's Pitch and Range<br></li><li>Choose your Theremin's Color<br></li><li>Left hand and right hand support (you can turn the instrument)<br></li><li>A Metronome<br></li><li>Concert Hall Reverb (optional)<br></li><li>More features might be added in the future</li></ul>",
